[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m First, let's express \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) in terms of \(\theta\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ z = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ \frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m Now, substitute \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 4i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m And
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = \frac{1}{4}(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 96i \sin \theta + 144i \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i(96 \sin \theta + 144 \cos \theta)) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta) + \frac{1}{4}i(96 \sin \theta + 144 \cos \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i(24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m Now, we add these two expressions together:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 4i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i(24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = (4 \cdot 75 \cos \theta - 4 \cdot 117 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta) + i(4 \cdot 75 \sin \theta + 4 \cdot 117 \cos \theta + 24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=215365)[0m \[ = (300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta) + i(300 \sin \theta + 468 \cos \theta + 24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta) \]
